Package: CoMMSur
Type: Package
Title: CoMM-Surv: Bayesian Survival Mediation with Configuration-Based Prior
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yung-Han", "Chang", role = c("aut","cre"), email = "YChang11@mdanderson.org")
  )
Description: Fit a Bayesian survival mediation model with multiple mediators and right-censored time-to-event outcome using a configuration-based joint prior. Provides mediator-level posterior probabilities for the null/alternative hypothesis and each of the 9 joint configuration components.
